<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.4.4">
<l>kaṭalkaṭainta mutamkoṇṭu kalacattai niṟaittāṟpōl</l>
<l>uṭaluruki vāytiṟantu maṭuttuṉṉai niṟaittukoṇṭēṉ</l>
<l>koṭumaiceyyuñ kūṟṟamumeṉ kōlāṭi kuṟukapeṟā</l>
<l>taṭavaraittōḷ cakarapāṇī cārṅkaviṟ cēvakaṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Like one filling a pot with nectar from the curned sea</l>
<l rend="indent">[my] body melting, mouth opening,</l>
<l>I took and drank of you [to my] fill.</l>
<l>Swinging my stick, cruel Death won’t get to approach,</l>
<l>O you with the broad mountian [like] shoulders</l>
<l rend="indent">who weilds the discus!</l>
<l>Śārṅga bow warrior!</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
